---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+16105550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(610) 555-0199';
---
<Layout>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container hero-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="hero-badge">● NEWTOWN SQUARE &amp; DELAWARE COUNTY · 24 / 7 EMERGENCY SERVICE</div>
        <h1>AC REPAIR IN<br /><span>NEWTOWN SQUARE</span></h1>
        <p class="hero-sub">Fast Fixes. Cool Relief. Same-Day Service.</p>
        <p class="hero-desc">When your air conditioner fails in Newtown Square, every hot hour counts. Our licensed technicians are on call around the clock — delivering expert repairs, upfront pricing, and workmanship backed by a written guarantee for homes across Delaware County.</p>
        <div class="hero-tags">
          <span class="hero-tag">⏱ Same-Day Response</span>
          <span class="hero-tag">🛡 Licensed &amp; Insured</span>
          <span class="hero-tag">✓ Upfront Pricing</span>
          <span class="hero-tag">📞 24 / 7 Emergency</span>
          <span class="hero-tag">🛡 Workmanship Guarantee</span>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-ctas">
          <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Schedule an Appointment</a>
          <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-outline">Get a Quote</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-visual">
        <div class="hero-card">
          <div class="hero-card-icon">❄️</div>
          <h3>No Cool Air?</h3>
          <p>We diagnose and repair central AC, ductless mini-splits, heat pumps &amp; more the same day in most cases.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Why Us -->
  <section class="section section-alt" id="why">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Why Newtown Square Homeowners <span>Choose Us</span></h2>
        <p>Newtown Square summers are humid and hot. When your AC struggles, you need a licensed local specialist who responds the same day and repairs it right the first time.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="features-grid">
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">⚡</div>
          <h3>Same-Day Diagnosis &amp; Repair</h3>
          <p>Most same-day AC repair calls in Newtown Square are completed within hours of your call — no multi-day waits.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">📜</div>
          <h3>Licensed &amp; Certified</h3>
          <p>Every technician is licensed, insured, and trained on central AC, ductless, heat pumps, and all major brands common in Delaware County.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">💵</div>
          <h3>Upfront Pricing, Zero Surprises</h3>
          <p>We quote before we work. No hidden fees, no upsell pressure — just honest AC repair at fair local rates.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">📍</div>
          <h3>Local to Newtown Square</h3>
          <p>Based on West Chester Pike — we know the housing stock, common systems (Carrier, Trane, Lennox, Goodman), and local climate demands.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="stats-row">
        <div class="stat-item"><strong>45 min</strong><span>Avg. Response</span></div>
        <div class="stat-item"><strong>97%</strong><span>First-Visit Fix Rate</span></div>
        <div class="stat-item"><strong>24/7</strong><span>Emergency Available</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Problems preview -->
  <section class="section" id="problems">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Recognize <span>These Signs?</span></h2>
        <p>Age, humidity, and heavy use accelerate AC wear in Newtown Square. If your system shows any of these symptoms, don't wait.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="problems-grid">
        <a href="/problems/no-cool-air/" class="problem-card" style="display:block">
          <span class="problem-badge badge-urgent">Urgent</span>
          <h3>No Cool Air</h3>
          <p>Warm air or no cooling often means low refrigerant, failed compressor, or capacitor issues. Same-day service restores comfort fast.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/problems/ac-not-turning-on/" class="problem-card" style="display:block">
          <span class="problem-badge badge-urgent">Urgent</span>
          <h3>AC Not Turning On</h3>
          <p>Unit won't start — could be thermostat, contactor, capacitor, or electrical. Quick diagnosis prevents bigger failures.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/problems/strange-noises/" class="problem-card" style="display:block">
          <span class="problem-badge badge-soon">Address Soon</span>
          <h3>Strange Noises</h3>
          <p>Rattling, grinding, or squealing usually signals loose parts, failing motor, or debris. Early repair extends system life.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/problems/weak-airflow/" class="problem-card" style="display:block">
          <span class="problem-badge badge-soon">Address Soon</span>
          <h3>Weak Airflow</h3>
          <p>Reduced airflow points to dirty filters, clogged coils, or duct issues. Fixing it improves efficiency and comfort.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/problems/high-energy-bills/" class="problem-card" style="display:block">
          <span class="problem-badge badge-monitor">Monitor</span>
          <h3>High Energy Bills</h3>
          <p>Spiking bills often mean the system is working harder than it should — dirty coils, low refrigerant, or aging equipment.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="/problems/leaking-ac/" class="problem-card" style="display:block">
          <span class="problem-badge badge-urgent">Urgent</span>
          <h3>Leaking AC Unit</h3>
          <p>Water around the indoor unit or outdoor pad signals condensate drain clogs or refrigerant leaks. Act before damage spreads.</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Services -->
  <section class="section section-alt" id="services">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Expert AC Repair <span>Services</span></h2>
        <p>Every cooling problem has a root cause. Our certified technicians diagnose accurately and repair correctly.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="services-grid">
        <div class="service-card">
          <div class="service-label">Urgent Response</div>
          <h3>Emergency AC Repair</h3>
          <p>When the heat hits and your AC fails, we respond around the clock — no after-hours surcharge surprises.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Available 24 / 7</li>
            <li>Avg. response under 60 min</li>
            <li>Stocked service vehicles</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/services/emergency-ac-repair/" class="btn btn-outline-dark">Learn More</a>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <div class="service-label">Most Common</div>
          <h3>Central AC Repair</h3>
          <p>Capacitors, contactors, compressors, coils, and full diagnostics for all major brands.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>All major brands</li>
            <li>Written estimate first</li>
            <li>Same-visit repairs</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/services/central-ac-repair/" class="btn btn-outline-dark">Learn More</a>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <div class="service-label">Modern Systems</div>
          <h3>Ductless Mini-Split Repair</h3>
          <p>Error codes, sensors, outdoor units, and line set issues for Mitsubishi, Fujitsu, Daikin, and more.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Brand specialists</li>
            <li>Zoning expertise</li>
            <li>Same-visit when possible</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/services/ductless-mini-split-repair/" class="btn btn-outline-dark">Learn More</a>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <div class="service-label">Year-Round</div>
          <h3>Heat Pump Repair</h3>
          <p>Heating and cooling mode issues, reversing valves, defrost controls, and efficiency tune-ups.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Dual-mode diagnostics</li>
            <li>All major brands</li>
            <li>Honest repair vs replace</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/services/heat-pump-repair/" class="btn btn-outline-dark">Learn More</a>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <div class="service-label">Preventive</div>
          <h3>AC Maintenance &amp; Tune-Up</h3>
          <p>Coil cleaning, refrigerant check, electrical inspection, and filter guidance to keep systems efficient.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Full system inspection</li>
            <li>Performance testing</li>
            <li>Seasonal readiness</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/services/ac-maintenance/" class="btn btn-outline-dark">Learn More</a>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <div class="service-label">Replacement</div>
          <h3>AC Installation</h3>
          <p>Properly sized, code-compliant central AC, heat pump, and ductless installs for Newtown Square homes.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Load calculation sizing</li>
            <li>Permit guidance</li>
            <li>Workmanship warranty</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/services/ac-installation/" class="btn btn-outline-dark">Learn More</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Process -->
  <section class="section" id="process">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>How We Restore Your <span>Cool Air</span></h2>
        <p>Every Newtown Square AC repair follows a structured, transparent process.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="process-steps">
        <div class="process-step">
          <div class="step-num">01</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Scheduling &amp; Same-Day Response</h3>
            <p>Call or text. We confirm your appointment quickly — often offering same-day slots. We gather a brief symptom overview so the technician arrives prepared.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step">
          <div class="step-num">02</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Precision Diagnostic Inspection</h3>
            <p>We test capacitors, contactors, refrigerant levels, airflow, electrical connections, and look for leaks or wear. Problems are identified with instruments, not assumptions.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step">
          <div class="step-num">03</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Honest Findings &amp; Repair Options</h3>
            <p>Before any work begins, your technician explains exactly what was found in plain language. You receive a clear written estimate. No pressure.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step">
          <div class="step-num">04</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Skilled Repair</h3>
            <p>With your approval, the repair begins. Service vehicles carry common parts so most jobs finish on the first visit.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="process-step">
          <div class="step-num">05</div>
          <div>
            <h3>Performance Verification</h3>
            <p>We verify cooling output, check for leaks, confirm thermostat response, and leave you with a post-repair summary.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Map / Location -->
  <section class="section section-alt" id="location">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Find Us in <span>Newtown Square, PA</span></h2>
        <p>Proudly serving Newtown Square and all of Delaware County from West Chester Pike.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="map-wrapper">
        <iframe title="Map of 3728 West Chester Pike, Newtown Square, PA" src="https://www.openstreetmap.org/export/embed.html?bbox=-75.413362%2C39.976488%2C-75.393362%2C39.996488&amp;layer=mapnik&amp;marker=39.986488%2C-75.403362" loading="lazy"></iframe>
      </div>
      <div class="map-info">
        <h3>📍 3728 West Chester Pike, Newtown Square, PA 19073</h3>
        <p>Serving Newtown Square · Broomall · Media · Wayne · Havertown · Springfield · Marple · and surrounding Delaware County communities.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="cta-banner">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>AC Down in Newtown Square?</h2>
      <p>Don't suffer through the heat. If your system stopped cooling, is leaking, or is making unusual sounds — our team can respond today.</p>
      <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call Now — {phoneDisplay}</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ -->
  <section class="section" id="faq">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>AC Repair <span>Questions</span></h2>
        <p>Real answers to what Newtown Square homeowners ask most.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-list">
        <div class="faq-item">
          <h3>My AC stopped producing cool air — is this an emergency?</h3>
          <p>Yes, especially during heat waves or with kids, elderly residents, or medical needs. Most complete failures trace to a failed capacitor, contactor, low refrigerant, or thermostat issue. Emergency calls placed earlier in the day are typically completed same-day.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <h3>How much does AC repair cost in Newtown Square?</h3>
          <p>Simple fixes (capacitor, contactor, thermostat) often range from a few hundred dollars. We provide a written estimate before any work begins. Replacement is recommended when the unit is old and repair exceeds roughly 50% of replacement cost.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <h3>Do you repair both central AC and ductless systems?</h3>
          <p>Yes. We service traditional central air, ductless mini-splits, heat pumps, and hybrid systems from all major brands including Carrier, Trane, Lennox, Goodman, Mitsubishi, Daikin, and more.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <h3>Are you licensed and insured in Pennsylvania?</h3>
          <p>Yes. All work is performed by licensed, insured technicians familiar with Pennsylvania codes and best practices for cooling systems in Newtown Square and Delaware County.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-item">
          <h3>Should I repair or replace my air conditioner?</h3>
          <p>Repair usually makes sense if the unit is under 10–12 years old and the issue is isolated. Replacement is worth evaluating for units 12+ years old, recurring failures, or when repair cost approaches half the value of a new system. We give an honest assessment either way.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
